1c:["$","section","Step 2: select eligible Hungarian programmes",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 2: select eligible Hungarian programmes"}],[["$","p","Search courses offered to your sending partner and check the host institution's admission page. Compare curriculum, prerequisites, teaching language, location and degree level. The previous official timeline allowed two choices; confirm the new call's selection rules before assuming the same limit.",{"children":"Search courses offered to your sending partner and check the host institution's admission page. Compare curriculum, prerequisites, teaching language, location and degree level. The previous official timeline allowed two choices; confirm the new call's selection rules before assuming the same limit."}],["$","p","A strong selection explains why each course fits your existing qualification and future work. For a doctoral course, check whether a supervisor statement or research proposal is required by the chosen doctoral school.",{"children":"A strong selection explains why each course fits your existing qualification and future work. For a doctoral course, check whether a supervisor statement or research proposal is required by the chosen doctoral school."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1d:["$","section","Step 3: prepare documents and language evidence",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 3: prepare documents and language evidence"}],[["$","p","Use the intake-specific application documents list. Academic records, an identification document, a motivation letter and proof of language ability are common categories, but exact requirements vary by study level and course. Do not substitute a generic internet checklist for the host university's instructions.",{"children":"Use the intake-specific application documents list. Academic records, an identification document, a motivation letter and proof of language ability are common categories, but exact requirements vary by study level and course. Do not substitute a generic internet checklist for the host university's instructions."}],["$","p","Some institutions may accept evidence of previous education in the course language; others require a test or a higher level. Ask the university for written clarification if it does not explain whether a Medium of Instruction certificate qualifies.",{"children":"Some institutions may accept evidence of previous education in the course language; others require a test or a higher level. Ask the university for written clarification if it does not explain whether a Medium of Instruction certificate qualifies."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Degree and academic transcripts",{"children":"Degree and academic transcripts"}],["$","li","Identity and nationality documents",{"children":"Identity and nationality documents"}],["$","li","Motivation and course-fit statement",{"children":"Motivation and course-fit statement"}],["$","li","Language proof accepted by the host university",{"children":"Language proof accepted by the host university"}],["$","li","Research plan or supervisor evidence where required",{"children":"Research plan or supervisor evidence where required"}]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","Step 4: complete both submission routes",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 4: complete both submission routes"}],[["$","p","Complete the scholarship portal and your sending partner's process. Keep copies of the submitted forms and the exact documents used in both. A completed portal form alone does not prove nomination.",{"children":"Complete the scholarship portal and your sending partner's process. Keep copies of the submitted forms and the exact documents used in both. A completed portal form alone does not prove nomination."}],["$","p","After the partner's nomination, universities may contact shortlisted applicants for an entrance assessment. Check your inbox and official portal regularly; verify any interview invitation comes from a legitimate institutional address.",{"children":"After the partner's nomination, universities may contact shortlisted applicants for an entrance assessment. Check your inbox and official portal regularly; verify any interview invitation comes from a legitimate institutional address."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1f:["$","section","Step 5: compare funding with your real budget",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 5: compare funding with your real budget"}],[["$","p","The programme offers tuition exemption, a stipend, accommodation support and health care provisions, with different stipend arrangements for doctoral applicants. The official overview warns that the award does not necessarily meet all living expenses.",{"children":"The programme offers tuition exemption, a stipend, accommodation support and health care provisions, with different stipend arrangements for doctoral applicants. The official overview warns that the award does not necessarily meet all living expenses."}],["$","p","Estimate upfront travel and housing deposits plus ongoing rent and utilities. Confirm whether your offer includes a dormitory place, when payments start and what conditions govern continuation of support.",{"children":"Estimate upfront travel and housing deposits plus ongoing rent and utilities. Confirm whether your offer includes a dormitory place, when payments start and what conditions govern continuation of support."}]],"$undefined"]}]
